026-10-20T13:36:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695289","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5133500-1846651706689772","game_id":"steam-5133500","kind":"update","title":"The Final Demo Update Before Steam Next Fest Is Here!","summary":"Steam Next Fest is almost here—and Kuroi Pen is joining the celebration!For our final demo update before the festival, we've given Ren and Ayame's first night a fresh touch:- New scene-specific music and sound effects.- More expressive character moments and refined lighting.- An optional drawing interaction.- Farewell dialogue that remembers more of your choices.- A new sketchbook comparison and refreshed ending screen.- Expanded settings to make the experience your own.All additions are availab","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:17:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5133500-1846018067940707","game_id":"steam-5133500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Translation Improvements","summary":"The Kuroi Pen demo's translations have been reviewed and refined.This update focuses on more natural dialogue, clearer wording, and consistent terminology in both the story and interface. Particular attention was given to preserving each character's voice and the intended meaning of the original text.Thank you for playing Kuroi Pen. Feedback on the updated translations is welcome.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:49:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940707","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:0